Source: aom-retold-wine-steam
Section: contrib/games
Priority: optional
Maintainer: John-Michael Mulesa <jmulesa@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), curl, ca-certificates, icoutils, gbe-fork-bin
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://steamdb.info/app/1934680/
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: aom-retold-wine-steam
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: gamelaunch, gbe-fork-bin, agelanserver-bin, agelanserver-companion-bin, ${pt:Depends}, aom-retold-wine-steam-data1 (= ${binary:Version}), aom-retold-wine-steam-data2 (= ${binary:Version}), aom-retold-wine-steam-data3 (= ${binary:Version}), aom-retold-wine-steam-data4 (= ${binary:Version}), aom-retold-wine-steam-data5 (= ${binary:Version}), aom-retold-wine-steam-data6 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Age of Mythology: Retold using Wine with data via Steam, ageLANServer for LAN
 Age of Mythology: Retold, run through gamelaunch
 (umu/Proton or system wine) with the game data downloaded from Steam and the
 Goldberg Steam emulator (gbe-fork-bin). ageLANServer and its launcher
 companion DLLs restore LAN multiplayer lobbies without the official servers.

